Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.174 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: WELCOME BACK.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.309 line:78%
A GREAT PART ABOUT MY JOB IS

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:12.479 line:78%
INTRODUCING OUR AUDIENCE TOO

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:13.213 line:78%
YOUNG, GOOD-LOOKING TALENT.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.182 line:78%
OUR NEXT STAND-UP COMEDIAN IS

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:16.816 line:78%
NONE OF THAT.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:20.253 line:78%
PLEASE WELCOME JOE DeVITO.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:20.920 line:78%
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.757 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HELLO!

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.124 line:78%
HELLO, THANK YOU.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:27.394 line:78%
THANK YOU.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:29.062 line:78%
HI, YES.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.163 line:78%
YES.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.430 line:78%
FEEL THE RELIEF FACTOR KICKING

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:33.233 line:78%
IN.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.667 line:78%
YOU CAN FEEL IT.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.369 line:78%
GOOD TO SEE YOU GUYS COME UP.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.171 line:78%
FOLKS, I'LL BE HONEST, I DID NOT

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.672 line:78%
GET INTO SHOW BUSINESS TO BECOME

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:44.044 line:78%
RICH AND FAMOUS, AND SO FAR,

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:44.644 line:78%
MISSION ACCOMPLISHED.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.247 line:78%
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.947 line:78%
I THINK THAT IS WHY THE WHOLE

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:51.418 line:78%
JOHNNY DEPP-AMBER HEARD TRIAL

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:53.486 line:78%
WAS SO GOOD FOR MY SELF-ESTEEM.

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:54.454 line:78%
I NEEDED TO SEE GOOD LOOKING,

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:57.924 line:78%
WEALTHY PEOPLE, WHO MADE WORSE

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.892 line:78%
CHOICES THAN I DO.

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.093 line:78%
BECAUSE I HAVE HAD SOME BAD

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.928 line:78%
RELATIONSHIPS.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:05.632 line:78%
YOU KNOW WHAT I'VE NEVER HAD?

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:08.301 line:78%
SOMEONE POOP IN MY BED.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:11.037 line:78%
EVER.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:13.006 line:78%
SO MAYBE I HAVE NEVER KNOWN TRUE

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:15.575 line:78%
LOVE.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:19.979 line:78%
BUT IT GAVE ME A NEW DEFINITION

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:22.182 line:78%
TO THE WORD "DEAL BREAKER."

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.549 line:78%
AND FOR THE WORDS AMBER ALERT.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:28.121 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:29.856 line:78%
[APPLAUSE]

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.591 line:78%
I HAVE NEVER BEEN MARRIED, AND

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:35.261 line:78%
AT AGE 53, I'M STARTING TO

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:36.830 line:78%
THINK, MAYBE IT IS ME.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.698 line:78%
BUT I DO HAVE HOPES AND DREAMS.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:41.434 line:78%
I WOULD LIKE TO HAVE KIDS ONE

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:44.838 line:78%
DAY, BUT JUST FOR THE ONE DAY.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:45.338 line:78%
VERY ANNOYING.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:50.677 line:78%
I PLANNED AHEAD.

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:51.311 line:78%
I FROZE MY SPERM YEARS AGO.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.846 line:78%
YEAH, YEAH.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:55.381 line:78%
AND EVERYONE SAID I WAS CRAZY

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:57.884 line:78%
BECAUSE I DIDN'T GO TOO, LIKE, A

00:01:55.482 --> 00:02:02.856 line:78%
PLACE.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:04.858 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:06.126 line:78%
BUT WHEN YOU ARE SINGLE OVER A

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.693 line:78%
CERTAIN AGE, YOU HAVE TO BE VERY

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:07.927 line:78%
DIRECT.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.228 line:78%
WE HAVE TO BE RIGHT ON THE

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.363 line:78%
MONEY.

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:12.165 line:78%
I TELL PEOPLE IF YOU'RE OVER 50

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.899 line:78%
AND DATING ONLINE, FIRST WORDS

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:16.636 line:78%
TO YOUR PROFILE SHOULD BECOME

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:20.473 line:78%
ALL RIGHT, LOOK.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:26.246 line:78%
YOU ARE NO BARGAIN, EITHER.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:28.248 line:78%
AND YOU TAKE IT FROM THERE.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.581 line:78%
I DON'T USE DATING TECHNOLOGY

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:29.649 line:78%
ANYMORE.

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:33.353 line:78%
NO MORE APPS, NOTHING.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:33.686 line:78%
SOMEONE ASKED ME IF I DO 

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:37.390 line:78%
SEXTING.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:40.460 line:78%
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA HOW BIG MY

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:42.262 line:78%
FONT IS?

