YOU CAN READ MY TEXTS FROM YOUR

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:47.000 line:78%
PHONE, OKAY?

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:49.636 line:78%
I CAN'T SEE -- THEY COME IN ONE

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.737 line:78%
LETTER AT A TIME LIKE A

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:55.675 line:78%
FAX MACHINE.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:56.042 line:78%
THERE IS NOTHING SEXY ABOUT

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:56.843 line:78%
SQUINTING.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:03:02.448 line:78%
WHAT'S THIS?

00:02:56.943 --> 00:03:06.052 line:78%
AN EVENT FOR HOT SINGLES?

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:09.022 line:78%
IT SAYS I NEED A SHOT TO PREVENT

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:10.023 line:78%
SHINGLES.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:12.859 line:78%
WELL, EITHER WAY, I WILL SEE YOU

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:15.495 line:78%
AT WALGREENS.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:16.996 line:78%
THAT'S THE DEMO I AM IN NOW,

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:17.330 line:78%
WHAT I GET UNSOLICITED MEDICAL

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.464 line:78%
ADVICE.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.866 line:78%
BUT IT JUST SHOWS UP.

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:20.767 line:78%
WHEN I WAS YOUNGER AND I WOULD

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:22.602 line:78%
SEE THOSE MEDICAL COMMERCIALS, I

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:25.905 line:78%
WOULD IGNORE THEM.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:30.109 line:78%
NOW I'M LIKE, GET A PEN.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:32.579 line:78%
I WOULD LIKE MORE INFORMATION.

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:36.950 line:78%
I DON'T KNOW, MAYBE I DO HAVE

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:40.253 line:78%
MESOTHELIOMA, I DON'T KNOW.

