00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:50.163 line:78%
IS THAT WHERE I GOT SHINGLES?

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:51.564 line:78%
I DON'T EVEN KNOW WHO I AM

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:54.400 line:78%
ANYMORE.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:54.667 line:78%
I'LL TELL YOU WHO I FEEL BAD 

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.270 line:78%
FOR.

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:58.805 line:78%
WOMEN NAMED KAREN.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:00.039 line:78%
YOU'VE HAD A ROUGH RUN.

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:01.975 line:78%
THEY HAVE.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:04.077 line:78%
AND SOMETIMES, THEY HAVE

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:04.644 line:78%
LEGITIMATE ISSUES WITH CUSTOMER

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:06.246 line:78%
SERVICE.

