I KNOW THERE'S A PROBLEM BECAUSE

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.993 line:78%
I'VE A FRIEND NAMED KAREN AND

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:21.160 line:78%
SHE WAS DISTRAUGHT.

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.527 line:78%
SHE SAID TO ME, THIS IS

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:23.062 line:78%
TERRIBLE.

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:24.497 line:78%
I LOVE MY NAME AND NOW PEOPLE

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:24.998 line:78%
USE MY NAME TO MEET AN ANNOYING

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:26.899 line:78%
WHITE WOMAN.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.433 line:78%
IT IS UNFAIR AND I DON'T LIKE

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.837 line:78%
IT.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:30.970 line:78%
AND I SAID WELL, LOOK AT YOU,

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:30.970 line:78%
COMP

